/Title (Apply the reparameterization trick: z = mu + eps * std, where std = exp\(0.5 * logvar\) and eps is random noise. Build the Decoder: a linear layer and three ConvTranspose2d layers with a Sigmoid output that reconstructs a 3 x 32 x 32 image from z.)
